WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.697
Every synthesizer has a
sound in it that's yours.

00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:10.105
Finding it means turning
hundreds of knobs, one at a time.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.927
Auracle is a synthesizer
that searches for your sound.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.456
It plays you two patches.

00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:22.510
You pick the one you like better.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.037
Every pick teaches it your taste,

00:00:25.487 --> 00:00:27.585
and it grows new patches toward it.

00:00:28.085 --> 00:00:32.565
Not samples. Real modular circuits,
built and wired from scratch.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.383
Then you play it.

00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:39.898
Turn Bright, and it finds the knobs
that make this patch brighter.

00:00:40.698 --> 00:00:44.283
Let it wander, and the knobs turn
themselves toward your taste.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.940
Press Offer, and a new version
grows from the sound in your hands.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.874
Blend into it. Take it, or pass.

00:00:52.874 --> 00:00:54.410
Either way, it learns.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.887
Open the circuit any time.

00:00:59.887 --> 00:01:04.285
Every knob is real, and you can
watch the performance turn them.

00:01:04.985 --> 00:01:10.281
Underneath, a model of your taste bets on
every choice before you make it, and keeps

00:01:10.281 --> 00:01:11.290
score in public.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.637
Every note in this film is Auracle.

00:01:18.637 --> 00:01:21.690
Free, open source, and
running in your browser.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.007
Play it today.
